            <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

The fingerprint value (e.g., the hex digest). DataFingerprint.value.</body>
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="cdif.bbr.metadata.cdifDataType.cdifDataFingerprint.DataFingerprint.value"/>
          </ownedComment>
